repository-code: "https://github.com/BeastAyyG/ardupilot-log-diagnosis"
license: MIT
version: "3.0"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
keywords:
  - ArduPilot
  - UAV
  - flight logs
  - fault diagnosis
  - benchmark
  - evaluation leakage
abstract: >-
  An incident-level benchmark of real ArduPilot crash logs whose root-cause
  labels each cite a verbatim forum diagnosis, together with a pre-registered
  evaluation showing that random window splits inflate macro-F1 from chance
  level to about 0.97.
